WEBVTT

00:12:58.431 --> 00:13:00.956
je bil, ko sem dobila...
no, pred tem trenutkom zdaj...

00:13:00.956 --> 00:13:05.384
(Smeh) (Aplavz)

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.866
… najpomembnejši trenutek

00:13:11.882 --> 00:13:13.915
je bil, ko sem dobila priložnost nastopiti

00:13:13.915 --> 00:13:16.234
za človeka, ki lebdi kot metulj

00:13:16.234 --> 00:13:17.603
in zbode kot čebela,

00:13:17.603 --> 00:13:21.099
ki ima Parkinsonovo bolezen 
in se trese kakor jaz,

00:13:21.099 --> 00:13:23.356
za Muhammada Alija.

00:13:23.356 --> 00:13:28.542
(Aplavz)